      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تدبّق</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a thing) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, sticky,
glutinous, viscous,</i> or <i>ropy.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>It</i> (a bird)
<i>was,</i> or <i>became, caught by means of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِبْق</span> [or <i>birdlime</i>]; (K, TA;) i. e. <i>it stuck,</i> or <i>adhered.</i> (TA.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَبِقَ</span>.])

